window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A forty something home organizer with ADHD has no choice but to return to her bizarre childhood home after her life falls apart in this enchanting series by USA Today bestselling author Jennifer L. Hart.</p> <p>This supernatural-sized omnibus collection includes the following titles</p> <p>Book 1 Midlife Magic Mirror</p> <p>Book 2 Midlife Magic Monster</p> <p>Book 3 Midlife Magic Malady</p> <p>Buy Legacy Witches of Shadow Cove: The Complete Series and summon the fun today!</p>"; 
